{"id":"976e00e7b4cdd6fd","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-indifference.md","title":"Indifference","display":"df-indifference — Indifference","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-indifference","aliases":["58-df-indifference"],"display":"df-indifference — Indifference","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-indifference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-indifference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indifference — Indifference"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,I\\in V\">\\(X,R,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (weak-preference relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S\\)</span> (indifference-relation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indifference} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S(I,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land I=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indifference} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S(I,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land I=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Indifference is the symmetric part of a weak preference relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indifference} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndifferenceRelation}_S(I,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land I=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true}],"bytes":704,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-673","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-indifference.md|58-df-indifference]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":[]}